ears, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids landed at 48% of normal, and November to December in 2025 at 69%. Grid 24184 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
